@startuml
title Appointment Reminder System - High Level Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Infomed Slis Server (MS SQL Server)" {
  [Slis Database] as SlisDB
  [Change Tracking] as CT
}

package "Sync Layer" {
  [Linked Server Connection] as LS
  [SQL Server Agent Job: Sync] as SyncJob
}

package "Own Operational DB (MS SQL Server)" {
  [Appointments Table]
  [PatientContacts Table]
  [NotificationLog Table]
  [SyncState Table]
}

package "Reminder Service" {
  [SQL Server Agent Job: Reminder Sender] as ReminderJob
  [easysms.gr API Client]
}

package "Webhook Receiver (ASP.NET Core)" {
  [POST /api/sms-callback]
}

cloud "easysms.gr API" {
  [api/mobile/check]
  [api/sms/send]
  [api/viber/send]
}

SlisDB --> CT : enables
CT --> LS : exposes changes via CHANGETABLE
LS --> SyncJob : queried by
SyncJob --> [Appointments Table] : MERGE / upsert
SyncJob --> [SyncState Table] : reads/writes last version

[Appointments Table] --> ReminderJob : reads pending appointments
ReminderJob --> [api/mobile/check] : validate number
ReminderJob --> [api/viber/send] : send Viber
ReminderJob --> [api/sms/send] : fallback SMS
ReminderJob --> [NotificationLog Table] : log sent status

[api/sms/send] --> [POST /api/sms-callback] : delivery report callback
[api/viber/send] --> [POST /api/sms-callback] : delivery report callback
[POST /api/sms-callback] --> [NotificationLog Table] : update delivery status

@enduml